---
/**
 * Concept illustration of the AI-to-human handover. Generic names, no metrics.
 * Not a product screenshot; labelled as an illustration.
 */
---

<figure class="thread relative">
  <div class="rounded-[1.25rem] border border-line bg-mist p-4 sm:p-6">
    <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-slate">
      <span class="font-semibold text-ink">Sam Rivera</span>
      <span>Messenger conversation</span>
    </div>

    <ol class="space-y-3" aria-label="Example conversation">
      <li class="msg flex">
        <p class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2.5">
          <span class="sr-only">Customer: </span>Hi, do you deliver on weekends?
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="msg flex flex-col items-end">
        <span class="mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-violet">
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              d="M6 0l1.4 4.6L12 6l-4.6 1.4L6 12 4.6 7.4 0 6l4.6-1.4z"
              fill="currentColor"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          AI assistant
        </span>
        <p class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md border border-violet/25 bg-[#f5effe] px-4 py-2.5">
          Yes. Orders placed before Friday at 5 pm can be delivered on Saturday. You can pick a day
          at checkout.
        </p>
        <span class="mt-1 text-[0.8125rem] text-slate">Answered from your knowledge base</span>
      </li>

      <li class="msg flex">
        <p class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2.5">
          <span class="sr-only">Customer: </span>My last order arrived damaged. Can I get a
          replacement?
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="msg handover flex items-center gap-3 py-1 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-teal">
        <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-teal/40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Handed to Nadia from your team
        <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-teal/40" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </li>

      <li class="msg flex flex-col items-end">
        <span class="mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-teal">
          <span
            class="grid size-4 place-items-center rounded-full bg-teal text-[0.625rem] text-white"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            N
          </span>
          Nadia, support team
        </span>
        <p class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md border border-teal/25 bg-[#e9f4f2] px-4 py-2.5">
          Sorry about that, Sam. I can send a replacement today. Could you share a photo of the
          parcel?
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate">
    Illustration of a conversation. Violet marks the AI, teal marks a person on your team.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .msg {
      animation: msg-in 420ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) both;
    }
    .msg:nth-child(1) {
      animation-delay: 150ms;
    }
    .msg:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 550ms;
    }
    .msg:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 1000ms;
    }
    .msg:nth-child(4) {
      animation-delay: 1400ms;
    }
    .msg:nth-child(5) {
      animation-delay: 1700ms;
    }
    .handover {
      animation-name: handover-in;
    }
  }

  @keyframes msg-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(8px);
    }
  }

  @keyframes handover-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
  }
</style>
